-- Purpose: Handles Legendary Car Shop logic. Strictly crafting system, persistent timers, sacrifice mechanics.
-- Runs on: Server
-- Location: ServerScriptService > LegendaryShopService
-- Dependencies: ReplicatedStorage.CarStats, ServerStorage.TycoonAdminAPI, TycoonDataHandler
